    extend "\n\n当日上午时段，沃尔库塔市政部门登记记录显示：经由有线电话、无线电及电报与沃尔库塔-5建立联系的历次尝试均告失败。{size=-8}{color=#999999} \n\nA complete failure to establish contact with Vorkuta-5 via landline, radio, or telegraph was registered by municipal authorities in Vorkuta during the late morning hours.{/color}{/size}"

